        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Xill Eggs"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "**Xill Eggs**\nDC: 24\nSaving Throw: Fortitude\nMaximum Duration: 24 hours\n- Stage 1: infested with no ill effect (8 hours)\n- Stage 2: sickened 1 (8 hours)\n- Stage 3: sickened 2 (4 hours)\n- Stage 3: sickened 2 and 2d6 persistent bleed damage as larval xills burrow out of the body and immediately fade away into the Ethereal Plane (1 hour)"
            },
            "id": "bd85018b-d65c-462a-8a01-ae68db519b86",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:08.154488"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Xill Paralysis"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(incapacitation, occult)\n\nA creature hit by the xill's bite Strike must attempt a 24 Fortitude save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected and is immune to xill paralysis for 1 minute.\n- **Success:** The creature is slowed 1 for 1 round.\n- **Failure:** The creature is paralyzed for 1 round.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is paralyzed. It can attempt a new save at the end of each of its turns to recover, and the save DC decreases by 1 each round."
            },
            "id": "71538ae4-ab9b-41f2-bfb9-2c581f063667",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:08.154488"
            }
          }
        }
